By the way:

The Gauntlets of Defense are another useful artifact that you might
want to wish for. They give half physical damage and can be used to
toggle invisibility.  But beware, they will blast you when you wish for
them and when you put them on, so make sure you have enough hit points.
 They will also block your special drow sleep attack, IIRC.

As others have mentioned, a blessed figurine of a Solar can be very
nice indeed.  But if you are unlucky and the Solar is hostile, it will
surely end your game.

As soon as you are tough enough ( MR + max. luck + enough HP ), you can
use a cursed scroll of genocide to create a gypsy farm.  If you have
enough patience, this will net you up to about 100 wishes before
gypsies become extinct. Spoiler for gypsy farming is available at
http://www.juiblex.co.uk/nethack/Shaligram/gypsy-006e4.txt , but it's a
little old.  Each gypsy will now only give you a maximum of one wish.



